+# TLS certificate verification
+
+The project's recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, with no build type exempt. This is paired with a recorded rule of HTTPS everywhere, with no exceptions, so development builds are expected to verify certificates like any other build.
